{"availability":"available","full":"vlad-lychak/financial-management-app","name":"financial-management-app","description":"📄 Financial management web application built with React, Redux, CSS and Firebase","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":18,"forks":12,"created":"2023-04-27T14:38:04Z","updated":"2025-07-22T11:18:05Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://budget-buddy-finance.netlify.app","topics":["css","cypress","firebase","jest-tests","react-firebase","reactjs","redux"],"demo":"https://budget-buddy-finance.netlify.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:41.336Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:41.336Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:41.336Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T11:07:41.336Z","stars":18,"forks":12}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A web application for managing your finance built using React, CSS, Redux, and Firebase.","This web-based financial management application was created to address a personal challenge I faced while working as a server. I struggled with accurately tracking my income and saving enough to cover my tax obligations. To solve this problem, I initially developed a tax calculator using Virginia tax rates. Building upon that, I added an income tracker to monitor my earnings, an expense tracker to keep track of my spending, and a budget planner to plan my finances effectively. I am continuously working on developing and improving this product to provide comprehensive financial management…"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/vlad-lychak/financial-management-app/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"693135cae186b89d8cd171394a2f5a8adaa3161cee92e60a8c5e72b561214193","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:41.441Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:41.441Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A web application for managing your finance built using React, CSS, Redux, and Firebase.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/vlad-